# build outputs: the Windows bats put .obj (+ the /Fd compiler PDB) in build/x86 and
# build/x64, one subdir per arch; CMake on Linux uses build/ too. Exe/PDB/MAP/SDL2.dll
# stay in SRC/ next to the game data.
*.obj
*.exe
*.pdb
*.map
*.ilk
*.dll
*_debug.log
build/

# third_party SDKs are committed as-is (SDL2.dll must not be ignored)
!third_party/**

# original game data and saves - never commit
*.SAV
*.avi
PILOTS.iso
PILOTS0
PILOTS0.*
